    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect the interior for any damages, stains, or signs of misuse.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Next, verify the odometer reading against the details mentioned in the Land Rover Bilty (delivery documentation).</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Odometer Comparison:</strong> Compare the displayed distance on the motorcycle's odometer with the information listed in the LR Bilty.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Record Details:</strong> Document any discrepancies between the displayed odometer reading and the recorded mileage in the LR Bilty.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Odometer Signature:</strong> Verify that the recipient or authorized representative has signed off on the odometer verification section of the LR Bilty.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>Before proceeding with the final handover, it is essential to ensure that the recipient or a designated representative signs off on the condition of the motorcycle.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
