<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Documentation Signature:</strong> Ensure that the recipient or authorized representative signs off on the condition report or any relevant documentation.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Maintenance and Safety Check:</strong> Conduct a brief check of essential maintenance items, such as oil levels, tire pressure, and any outstanding safety concerns.</span></li>
